This project is a Go port of FlareSolverr (https://github.com/FlareSolverr/FlareSolverr),
originally written in Python and distributed under the MIT License.

The HTTP API (`/`, `/health`, `/v1`), its request/response shapes, the command
semantics (`sessions.create`, `sessions.list`, `sessions.destroy`, `request.get`,
`request.post`) and the challenge-detection selectors are derived from that project.

